[0.000, "o", "PreToolUse:Bash says: [ACP·local] Blocked: force-push to main/master\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m The push was blocked by a hook/policy that prevents force-pushing to \u001b[38;5;153mmain\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;5;153mmaster\u001b[39m. I didn't bypass it — \u001b[18;1H  if this is intentional (e.g., branch protection), you may need to force-push from an environment with  \u001b[19;1H  the appropriate permissions or temporarily adjust the branch protection rule yourself.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCooked for 15s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H❯ stop trying the force-push — abandon it co\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n───────────────────────────"]
