[0.000, "o", "was blocked by a hook/policy that prevents force-pushing to \u001b[38;5;153mmain\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;5;153mmaster\u001b[39m. I didn't bypass it — \u001b[16;1H  if this is intentional (e.g., branch protection), you may need to force-push from an environment with  \u001b[17;1H  the appropriate permissions or temporarily adjust the branch protection rule yourself.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCooked for 15s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mstop trying the force-push — abandon it completely. unrelated task: run npm test once and tell me if\u001b[39m   \u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[22;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mit passes\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;174m\r\n✽\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mCombobulating…\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  Tip: Hit Enter to queue up additional messages while Claude is working.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
