[0.000, "o", ", you may need to force-push from an environment with  \u001b[14;1H  the appropriate permissions or temporarily adjust the branch protection rule yourself.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCooked for 15s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mstop trying the force-push — abandon it completely. unrelated task: run npm test once and tell me if\u001b[39m   \u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[19;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mit passes\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;153mnpm test\u001b[39m passes — 1 test, 1 pass, 0 fail.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mChurned for 6s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H❯ last thing: run exactly this to "]
