[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  Identity & governance for Claude Code + Codex + opencode\u001b[K\r\n  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  [ACP] Installing governance hook script...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [ACP] Governance hook installed (canonical (plugin repo))\u001b[K\r\n  [Claude Code] Setting up governance...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Claude Code] hooks + MCP registered directly (plugin CLI unavailable — update Claude Code for auto-updates)\u001b[K\r\n  [Codex] Setting up governance hooks...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Codex] codex_hooks enabled + PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks (local: shell commands governed on-device)\u001b[11;1H  \u001b[2m[opencode] Skipped in --local mode (its ACP plugin needs a workspace; local decisions aren't wired ther\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2me yet).\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32mALLOW\u001b[39m  local mode active — no account, nothing leaves your machine\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mHooks installed for:\u001b(B\u001b[m Claude Code, Codex\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mCodex note: its hooks cover shell commands today; non-Bash tools "]
[0.000, "o", "aren't hooked by Codex yet.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Decisions run on-device from \u001b[2m~/.acp/policy.json\u001b(B\u001b[m (edit it — allow / ask / deny).\u001b[K\r\n  Every call is logged to \u001b[2m~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2mtail -f ~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  The safety floor always blocks the catastrophic (rm -rf /, mkfs, dd, fork bombs,\u001b[K\r\n  force-push to main) regardless of policy.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Restart your AI client to activate the hook.\u001b[K\r\n  Want team control, cost X-ray, and a shared console across everyone's agents?\u001b[K\r\n  Re-run without \u001b[2m--local\u001b(B\u001b[m to connect a workspace.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n~/work/payments-api\u001b(B\u001b[m $ claude\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
